    "en": "Self-styled wandering herbalist Rose Salt, offering an array of herbal 'remedies' that may cause dizziness.",
    "zh": "自称是流浪草药医生的瑰盐，可以为你提供包括迷晕在内的一系列草药“治疗”。",
    "isMachineTranslation": false
  },
  "itemDesc": {
    "en": "She wants to hold all she desires in the palm of her hand, eternally chasing after her idea of the good life.",
    "zh": "想把自己渴望的一切都抓在手里，永远去追求自己想要的好生活。",
    "isMachineTranslation": false
  },
